      "cooked": "<p>The Sales Partners Commission report under Selling is a nice fetaure especially for marketplace sales. However, it is fundamentally lacks the time dimension and does not take into account the returns in Sales Invoices.</p>\n<p>Simply put, the positivity constraints on the <em>base_net_total</em> and thus <em>total_commission</em> is producing only forward sales process.</p>\n<p>AND IFNULL(base_net_total, 0) &gt; 0      AND IFNULL(total_commission, 0) &gt; 0</p>",
